  "instructions": [
    "Rinse 1 cup lentils until water runs clear and set aside.",
    "Heat 2 tbsp coconut oil in a pot over medium heat and add 1 tbsp mustard seeds until they pop.",
    "Add 1 tsp turmeric, 1 tsp red chili, and 1 tsp ginger, sauté for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Stir in 1 cup chopped onions and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add 2 chopped tomatoes and cook until they break down, about 4 minutes.",
    "Pour in 4 cups water, bring to a boil, then add lentils and 1 tsp salt; reduce heat and simmer for 25 minutes until lentils are tender.",
    "Stir in 1 tbsp tamarind paste, 100g kimchi, and 1 tbsp mirin honey; simmer for another 5 minutes.",
    "Ladle stew into bowls and serve hot."
  ],
